## Fonts

The font files in the `fonts/` directory (Alibaba PuHuiTi, 阿里巴巴普惠体) are
copyright © Alibaba and are **not** covered by the MIT license above. Their
legal notice can be found at https://www.yuque.com/yiguang-wkqc2/puhuiti/nus9wiinq4aeiegy
(latest version governs); see also `fonts/LICENSE-AlibabaPuHuiTi.md`.
The fonts were downloaded from the official website as README said, and all
the fonts included were extracted unmodified from the compressed package
downloaded from the official website.
